+# notes
+
+A tiny notes CLI.
+
+## Commands
+
+- `notes list [--store <file>]`: list every note.
+- `notes import <file> [--store <file>] [--dedupe] [--dry-run]`: append the notes in `<file>` to the store. `--dedupe` skips notes whose title and body match a note already stored. `--dry-run` prints what would be imported and writes nothing.
